{"id":"disfraz","lemma":"disfraz","pos":"noun","rank":2570,"glosses":["disguise","costume"],"ipa":"/disˈfɾaθ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"disfraces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-disfraz.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde puedo alquilar un disfraz?","en":"Where can I rent a costume?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/92631","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to rent"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom se sacó su disfraz.","en":"Tom removed his disguise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803529","words":[null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to put out, to get out","l":"sacar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"¿Cómo sería Halloween sin disfraces?","en":"What would Halloween be like without costumes?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"El niño sucio resultó ser un príncipe en disfraz.","en":"The dirty boy turned out to be a prince in disguise.","words":[null,null,{"g":"dirty, filthy"},{"g":"to result","l":"resultar"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"prince"},{"g":"in / on"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"the Christ child"]]},{"text":"Solo me falta la careta para que mi disfraz esté completo.","en":"All I need is the mask, and my costume is complete.","words":[{"g":"sole"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"lack, shortage"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"full, complete"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"so that"]]}]}